      <p>国产大厂的AI转型已经进入深水区，不再是烧钱讲故事，而是实打实地赚钱了... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
      <p>4. DeepSeek V4-Flash补上视觉能力... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
      <p>多模态Agent能力接近Claude Opus 4.8水平... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
      <h2>02 智慧仓储货架：AI正在跑在产线上... [Content continues in Chinese]</h2>
      <p>1. 稳石AI集群引领智能仓储... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
      <p>2. 隆德县打造县域智慧供应链... [Content continues in Chinese]</p>
